  "body": [
    "InsureShield® Shipping Insurance helps businesses recover faster after covered loss or damage to a shipment. Explore options for UPS packages, multi-carrier shipments, LTL freight, and international freight.",
    "Estimate only. Actual pricing and availability depend on the shipment, customer, coverage option, and applicable policy terms.",
    "=1MPackagesTrusted insurance provider62M packages insured in 2025*As a trusted insurance provider, UPS Capital Insurance Agency, Inc. is backed by AA-rated insurance capacity from one of the world's leading global insurers",
    "62M packages insured in 2025*",
    "Multi-carrier, multi-modal$85B global insured value in 2025*Insure eligible shipments across all parcel, ocean, and freight carriers, including UPS, FedEx, DHL, and USPS.",
    "$85B global insured value in 2025*",
    "Simpler insurance claims$132M in claims paid in 2025*File insurance claims online across carriers, check their status anytime, and keep recovery moving. Most claims are paid in days, not weeks.",
    "$132M in claims paid in 2025*",
    "Comprehensive protectionCoverage for insured shipments, including loss, damage, and porch piracy.",
    "Financial recoveryReimbursement up to the full sales value, including shipping costs.",
    "Peace of mindApply, review or add protection where it matters most.",
    "Reliable recoveryCoverage for expedited reshipping when shipping mishaps occur.*",
    "Turn on shipping insurance from the tools you use today. Connect through a marketplace app, or build it in with our API and webhooks.",
    "Integrations",
    "Integrations",
    "Protect ecommerce growth with CommerceShield™Use order risk signals and UPS delivery intelligence to make better-informed fulfillment decisions and address eligible chargeback exposure. API-ready, real-time risk scoring.Fraud preventionDispute evidenceRisk scoringLearn more",
    "Fraud prevention",
    "Dispute evidence",
    "Risk scoring",
    "Protect high-value goods with Parcel Pro®Ship valuable goods with specialized shipping, embedded insurance, risk controls, monitoring, and claims support in one Parcel Pro web application.High-value goodsEmbedded insuranceRisk controlsLearn more",
    "High-value goods",
    "Embedded insurance",
    "Risk controls",
    "See how InsureShield shipping insurance works and how it enables a better customer experience.",
    "Customer storyRAE Solutions, LLC grows customer satisfactionConsumer-elected protection provides peace of mind for company and its growing customer base.Read the story",
    "Customer story",
    "Customer storyProof keeps ice cream frozen & customers happy with InsureShield protectionHow Proof protects alcohol-infused ice cream shipments with shipping insurance designed for perishables.Read the story",
    "Customer story",
    "ArticleWhat is shipping insurance?What it covers, what it costs, and when a business needs it.Read the article",
    "Article",
    "ArticleCarrier liability vs shipping insuranceWhy a carrier’s liability is not the same as insuring the value of what you ship.Read the article",
    "Article",
    "Learn how shipping insurance works, what may be covered, and which option could fit your business."
